{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31057","headline":"送人归上党 · 薛能","name":"送人归上党","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕台基壤穴狐蛇，计拙因循岁月赊。\n兵革未销王在镐，桑蚕临熟客还家。\n霏微对岸漳边雨，堆阜邻疆蓟北沙。\n若到长平战场地，爲求遗镞辟魔邪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31057.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31057","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}